  "body": "## What changed\n\n`CreateOperation` never set an explicit order, so ops with no order sorted by **name** in the program: a 'Finish' created after a 'Rough' posted first, and since #103/#109 that order also decides the prior laws' verdicts.\n\n- `CreateOperation` now appends the op at the end of its setup's program order with an explicit index - the same append `PasteOperation` already did, shared as `append_position` (crates/app/src/commands/operation/create.rs). Siblings with no stored position (older projects) are pinned at their current name-order position, so nothing already in a program moves. Undo restores each sibling's previous `OperationMeta` (an old `None` comes back as `None`).\n- Old projects keep their name order on load (no load-time migration).\n- Tests that pinned the old behaviour:\n  - `remachining::program_order_is_the_posts_order_not_the_creation_order` pinned the documented \"Operation10 runs before Operation2\" wart; it is now `program_order_is_the_creation_order_not_the_name_order` - the op made first runs first, the other goes Stale naming it, Regenerate All masks it.\n  - `setup_sheet::sheet_orders_ops_by_the_program_law` now reorders explicitly (still \"the sheet follows the post, not history\"), and the sheet header reads \"setup rank, then position\".\n  - `operation_metadata::version_49_operations_keep_legacy_name_order` strips the stored positions from its downgraded fixture (a real v49 file never had them).\n- Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#167).\n\n## Gate (own worktree build, rebased on 0aa542f)\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --tests`: 113 of 114 binaries green; only `drilling_axial::a_drill_where_the_model_has_no_hole_is_convicted` fails (known on main, a 0.0006 mm lathe axis tolerance).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: green except the lib's `egui_shell_snapshot_light` (Diff 1) and `tool_editor_snapshot` (Diff 4) - software-GL diffs, same counts on main.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `operation_metadata::created_operations_post_in_creation_order_not_name_order` (Rough then Finish → Rough, Finish; B then A → B, A; undo/redo)\n- `operation_metadata::creating_after_legacy_unordered_ops_keeps_their_name_order` (legacy order kept, new op last, undo restores the unpinned meta)\n- `remachining::program_order_is_the_creation_order_not_the_name_order`\n\nChangelog: New operations post after their setup's existing ones in creation order, not in name order\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork).\n\nFixes #167\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
